  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hanoten_teshuah/closing">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/1"/>May the Supreme King of kings in His mercy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/2"/>sustain them in life and preserve them;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/3"/>and from all distress, sorrow, and hurt,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/4"/>may He save them.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/5"/>May the Supreme King of kings in His mercy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/6"/>instill in their hearts compassion
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/7"/>to do good with us
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/8"/>and with all Israel.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/9"/>In their days and in ours,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/10"/>may Judah be delivered
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/11"/>and Israel dwell in security,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/12"/>and the Redeemer come to Zion.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/13"/>May this be His will
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hanoten_teshuah/closing/14"/>and let us say, Amein.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
